{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DpMmuDo1kNxg2SRFoVBuDw","type":"tool_result","content":"1300\t## Module drive: cars on the ground plane, a race round a track, the drivers who race it (engine/modules/drive.js)\n1301\t\n1302\t- `new E.Car(o = {}) → car`: new E.Car({ x, y, angle, top, accel, brake, turn, grip, drift, kart, auto, surfaces, ground }): a car (the manual)\n1303\t- `E.Car.collide(cars)`: bump every pair of cars that touch apart (equal weights, a little bounce)\n1304\t- `car.boost(sec = .8, power = .4)`: a boost: seconds of it, power (.4: top speed up by that share)\n1305\t- `car.spinOut(sec = 1)`: spin out (a shot, a hazard): seconds without control, most of its speed lost\n1306\t- `car.update(dt, map, c = {})`: one step: steering, engine, grip, drift, the surface, then E.Body's walls and hop. c: an input or an intent\n1307\t- `car.airT = 0`: a hop's seconds in the air\n1308\t- `car.angle`: its heading\n1309\t- `car.boostT = 0`: a boost's seconds left\n1310\t- `car.bumped = false`: it hit a wall or a car this step\n1311\t- `car.charge = 0`: a kart's drift boost building (1 blue, 2 orange)\n1312\t- `car.drifting = 0`: -1 left, 1 right, 0 not\n1313\t- `car.o`: its options\n1314\t- `car.offroad = false`: on a surface that slows it\n1315\t- `car.onGround = false`, `car.vz`: E.Body's (a hop leaves the ground)\n1316\t- `car.slide = 0`: sideways\n1317\t- `car.speed = 0`: along it (units a second, - backing up)\n1318\t- `car.spinT = 0`: a spin-out's\n1319\t- `car.surface = null`: the floor tag under it\n1320\t- `car.vx`, `car.vy`: its speed on the ground (E.Body's): along its heading and the slide\n1321\t- `new E.Race(o = {}) → race`: new E.Race({ path, laps, checkpoints, countdown, width, items }): a race round a closed path (the manual)\n1322\t- `race.add(car, o = {})`: a racer: its car, o.name, o.input (a player's controls) or o.ai ({ skill, rubber, lane }); returns it\n1323\t- `race.box(x, y)`: an item box at (x, y): a racer that drives through it gets an item (when it holds none)\n1324\t- `race.drive(R, dt)`: a racer's way round: the intent race.update gives an AI racer's car (look ahead along the line, bends, overtakes, unsticking, the rubber band)\n1325\t- `race.grid(n)`: the start: n places behind the line, two by two, facing along it: [{ x, y, angle }]\n1326\t- `race.hud(r, R, o = {})`: the standard HUD for a racer, in its viewport: place, lap, time, item, the countdown, WRONG WAY, FINISH (o.color; o.right: the x its right-hand text ends before, clear of a corner button)\n1327\t- `race.update(dt, map)`: one step: the countdown, every car, bumps, items, progress, laps, wrong way, places, the finish\n1328\t- `race.use(R)`: fire a racer's item: boost (now), shot (ahead along its heading), hazard (behind it)\n1329\t- `race.boxes = []`, `race.hazards = []`, `race.shots = []`: the items on the track\n1330\t- `race.go = false`: racing (the countdown over)\n1331\t- `race.o`: its options\n1332\t- `race.over = false`: every racer finished\n1333\t- `race.path`: the racing line\n1334\t- `race.racers = []`: every racer, in the order added\n1335\t- `race.results = []`: the racers as they finished\n1336\t- `race.t`: seconds since GO (- before it)\n1337\t\n1338\t## Module fight: one-on-one fighting: fighters with frame data, guards, throws, specials, a meter; rounds; a CPU; training (engine/modules/fight.js)\n1339\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f93111a9-5060-4eb2-b5bf-6a1585c61e13","uuid":"49e6e784-96c1-464b-a649-86230b1a8f21","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:56:12.430Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/.cache/opus-plan-x531263/engine/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/API-INDEX.md","content":"## Module drive: cars on the ground plane, a race round a track, the drivers who race it (engine/modules/drive.js)\n\n- `new E.Car(o = {}) → car`: new E.Car({ x, y, angle, top, accel, brake, turn, grip, drift, kart, auto, surfaces, ground }): a car (the manual)\n- `E.Car.collide(cars)`: bump every pair of cars that touch apart (equal weights, a little bounce)\n- `car.boost(sec = .8, power = .4)`: a boost: seconds of it, power (.4: top speed up by that share)\n- `car.spinOut(sec = 1)`: spin out (a shot, a hazard): seconds without control, most of its speed lost\n- `car.update(dt, map, c = {})`: one step: steering, engine, grip, drift, the surface, then E.Body's walls and hop. c: an input or an intent\n- `car.airT = 0`: a hop's seconds in the air\n- `car.angle`: its heading\n- `car.boostT = 0`: a boost's seconds left\n- `car.bumped = false`: it hit a wall or a car this step\n- `car.charge = 0`: a kart's drift boost building (1 blue, 2 orange)\n- `car.drifting = 0`: -1 left, 1 right, 0 not\n- `car.o`: its options\n- `car.offroad = false`: on a surface that slows it\n- `car.onGround = false`, `car.vz`: E.Body's (a hop leaves the ground)\n- `car.slide = 0`: sideways\n- `car.speed = 0`: along it (units a second, - backing up)\n- `car.spinT = 0`: a spin-out's\n- `car.surface = null`: the floor tag under it\n- `car.vx`, `car.vy`: its speed on the ground (E.Body's): along its heading and the slide\n- `new E.Race(o = {}) → race`: new E.Race({ path, laps, checkpoints, countdown, width, items }): a race round a closed path (the manual)\n- `race.add(car, o = {})`: a racer: its car, o.name, o.input (a player's controls) or o.ai ({ skill, rubber, lane }); returns it\n- `race.box(x, y)`: an item box at (x, y): a racer that drives through it gets an item (when it holds none)\n- `race.drive(R, dt)`: a racer's way round: the intent race.update gives an AI racer's car (look ahead along the line, bends, overtakes, unsticking, the rubber band)\n- `race.grid(n)`: the start: n places behind the line, two by two, facing along it: [{ x, y, angle }]\n- `race.hud(r, R, o = {})`: the standard HUD for a racer, in its viewport: place, lap, time, item, the countdown, WRONG WAY, FINISH (o.color; o.right: the x its right-hand text ends before, clear of a corner button)\n- `race.update(dt, map)`: one step: the countdown, every car, bumps, items, progress, laps, wrong way, places, the finish\n- `race.use(R)`: fire a racer's item: boost (now), shot (ahead along its heading), hazard (behind it)\n- `race.boxes = []`, `race.hazards = []`, `race.shots = []`: the items on the track\n- `race.go = false`: racing (the countdown over)\n- `race.o`: its options\n- `race.over = false`: every racer finished\n- `race.path`: the racing line\n- `race.racers = []`: every racer, in the order added\n- `race.results = []`: the racers as they finished\n- `race.t`: seconds since GO (- before it)\n\n## Module fight: one-on-one fighting: fighters with frame data, guards, throws, specials, a meter; rounds; a CPU; training (engine/modules/fight.js)\n","numLines":40,"startLine":1300,"totalLines":1745}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01DpMmuDo1kNxg2SRFoVBuDw","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
