{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U9kyC7wwdAs54c4fRvDGy6","type":"tool_result","content":"186\t|---|---|---|\n187\t| `00-core.js` | game creation, constants, units, `OB.bus`, `OB.rand`, `OB.tuning` (live) + `OB.TUNING_DEFAULTS`, env flags (`OB.env.hub`, `OB.env.touchOnly`, `OB.env.headless`) | `OB.tune(key)`, `OB.bus.on/off/emit`, `OB.rand.stream()` |\n188\t| `01-data-world.js` | biome kits, 15 stages, route graph, 5 goals, hub/versus routes, sky presets | `OB.STAGES`, `OB.GOALS`, `OB.KITS`, `OB.ROUTES` |\n189\t| `01-data-cars.js` | Fioretti cars, colours, traffic types | `OB.CARS`, `OB.PAINTS`, `OB.TRAFFIC` |\n190\t| `01-data-play.js` | request types, mission list, unlock beds, economy constants | `OB.REQUESTS`, `OB.MISSIONS`, `OB.BEDS` |\n191\t| `01-data-cast.js` | characters (rig specs, voice params, colours) and every line of text: barks, requests, reactions, endings, briefs, help, credits | `OB.CAST`, `OB.LINES`, `OB.line(key, vars)` |\n192\t| `01-data-music.js` | songs (radio, themes, jingles) as engine song objects with instrument tracks | `OB.SONGS`, `OB.STATIONS` |\n193\t| `10-road.js` | `OB.World`: builds an `E.Road` per stage (junctions, strips, grounds), scenery placement from kit rules, landmark placement, roadside object lists, `OB.World.info(stage, z, x)` for physics | `world.stage(id)`, `world.junction(id)`, `info()` |"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f93111a9-5060-4eb2-b5bf-6a1585c61e13","uuid":"6d22a7f4-f20e-4e3d-90fd-df6fce856659","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:44:14.961Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174755__x531263/work/PLAN.md","content":"|---|---|---|\n| `00-core.js` | game creation, constants, units, `OB.bus`, `OB.rand`, `OB.tuning` (live) + `OB.TUNING_DEFAULTS`, env flags (`OB.env.hub`, `OB.env.touchOnly`, `OB.env.headless`) | `OB.tune(key)`, `OB.bus.on/off/emit`, `OB.rand.stream()` |\n| `01-data-world.js` | biome kits, 15 stages, route graph, 5 goals, hub/versus routes, sky presets | `OB.STAGES`, `OB.GOALS`, `OB.KITS`, `OB.ROUTES` |\n| `01-data-cars.js` | Fioretti cars, colours, traffic types | `OB.CARS`, `OB.PAINTS`, `OB.TRAFFIC` |\n| `01-data-play.js` | request types, mission list, unlock beds, economy constants | `OB.REQUESTS`, `OB.MISSIONS`, `OB.BEDS` |\n| `01-data-cast.js` | characters (rig specs, voice params, colours) and every line of text: barks, requests, reactions, endings, briefs, help, credits | `OB.CAST`, `OB.LINES`, `OB.line(key, vars)` |\n| `01-data-music.js` | songs (radio, themes, jingles) as engine song objects with instrument tracks | `OB.SONGS`, `OB.STATIONS` |\n| `10-road.js` | `OB.World`: builds an `E.Road` per stage (junctions, strips, grounds), scenery placement from kit rules, landmark placement, roadside object lists, `OB.World.info(stage, z, x)` for physics | `world.stage(id)`, `world.junction(id)`, `info()` |","numLines":8,"startLine":186,"totalLines":1754}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01U9kyC7wwdAs54c4fRvDGy6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
