{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W37SadfdByEsjoFhoByqUK","type":"tool_result","content":"1:# OutBloom 2006: Coast 2 Coast\n21:## Contents\n40:## 1. Quick facts\n62:## 2. What makes the source distinctive, and how OutBloom plays it\n86:## 3. Originality rules\n108:## 4. Deliverables, folders and setup\n110:### 4.1 Working rules (from TASK.md, made concrete)\n127:### 4.2 Dev folder layout\n145:### 4.3 The bundle (`node build.mjs`)\n162:## 5. Architecture\n164:### 5.1 Runtime shape\n183:### 5.2 Source files (`src/manifest.json` order)\n220:### 5.3 Scenes and flow\n242:### 5.4 Coordinates and units\n257:## 6. Engine changes (all in the dev copy; log each in `engine/CHANGES.md`)\n278:## 7. Systems\n280:### 7.1 Road world and route graph (`10-road.js`)\n318:### 7.2 Rendering a race frame (`51-race-scenes.js`, `13-fx.js`, `41-hud.js`)\n368:### 7.3 Car handling (`20-car.js`)\n446:### 7.4 Traffic (`21-traffic.js`)\n472:### 7.5 Rivals, bots and the shared driver brain (`22-drivers.js`)\n495:### 7.6 Run rules: clock, checkpoints, forks, goals, score and the Bloom chain (`23-race.js`)\n541:### 7.7 The passenger and Love in Bloom (`24-requests.js`, `12-cast.js`, `31-voice.js`)\n564:### 7.8 The Coast 2 Coast Tour: the career (`52-career.js`, `25-missions.js`)\n589:### 7.9 The Garage Garden and the economy (`26-progress.js`, `52-career.js`)\n604:### 7.10 Time Trial and ghosts\n616:### 7.11 Versus: two players on one screen (`53-modes.js`)\n632:### 7.12 AI Hub online (`70-hub.js`)\n677:### 7.13 Characters and animation (`12-cast.js`)\n724:### 7.14 Music and the radio (`01-data-music.js`, `30-synth.js`, `32-radio.js`)\n768:### 7.15 Sound effects, the engine note and ambience\n822:### 7.16 Voices: Animalese and Simlish-style babble (`31-voice.js`)\n864:### 7.17 UI and UX for 10 feet: screens and the UI kit (`40-ui.js`, `50-front.js`)\n906:### 7.18 The race HUD (`41-hud.js`)\n924:### 7.19 Input and prompts (`00-core.js`, `40-ui.js`; Appendix B