{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0146n9xcTsGAnfR541KA6yHZ","type":"tool_result","content":"195:| `11-art.js` | shape definitions (cars, traffic, landmarks, roadside sets, request objects), boot-time pre-rendering into sprite banks, recolouring, glyph and UI icons | `OB.Art.car(model, paint, yawIdx, layer)`, `OB.Art.sprite(id, variant)` |\n1412:- **Writing the shape.** Each car is an `E.SHAPES` entry (`OB:car-orchidea`) written facing south per the asset card\n1423:  - **Check it** with `node engine/tools/asset-sheet.mjs src/11-art.js#OB:car-orchidea-over`: the sheet shows every view\n1488:| R3 | **Car sprites from shapes might look crude, or boot slowly.** | Prototype the Orchidea in M1 and check it with `asset-sheet.mjs` and in-race screenshots. If the shape renderer can't give clean curves at 128 px, draw the body with `px.poly` profiles per yaw band (the ROAD kit's method, 33 frames), which is just as complete. If boot exceeds about 8 s, render the cars a race needs behind a short \"Polishing the chrome…\" boot step at race start. |","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f93111a9-5060-4eb2-b5bf-6a1585c61e13","uuid":"b3943458-60d2-4436-88df-87bc75a12400","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:45:17.306Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"195:| `11-art.js` | shape definitions (cars, traffic, landmarks, roadside sets, request objects), boot-time pre-rendering into sprite banks, recolouring, glyph and UI icons | `OB.Art.car(model, paint, yawIdx, layer)`, `OB.Art.sprite(id, variant)` |\n1412:- **Writing the shape.** Each car is an `E.SHAPES` entry (`OB:car-orchidea`) written facing south per the asset card\n1423:  - **Check it** with `node engine/tools/asset-sheet.mjs src/11-art.js#OB:car-orchidea-over`: the sheet shows every view\n1488:| R3 | **Car sprites from shapes might look crude, or boot slowly.** | Prototype the Orchidea in M1 and check it with `asset-sheet.mjs` and in-race screenshots. If the shape renderer can't g